<DocsExample TExample="AnimationBasicExample" Title="Fade in" Description="NTAnimation fades its content in when it scrolls into view. Without JavaScript the content stays visible." />
<DocsExample TExample="AnimationDirectionsExample" Title="Slide directions" Description="Animation selects how content enters. Distance controls how far the slide travels. Start and End follow the reading direction (RTL-aware)." />
<DocsExample TExample="AnimationTimingExample" Title="Duration, easing and stagger" Description="EnterDuration and EnterEasing use Material motion tokens, and Stagger animates each direct child in sequence." />
<DocsExample TExample="AnimationRepeatExample" Title="Animate out and back in" Description="Set Repeat to Reverse so content animates out below the threshold and back in as it re-enters. Replay resets it once fully off-screen." />
<DocsExample TExample="AnimationPatternsExample" Title="Material patterns" Description="ScaleIn, FadeThrough and the SharedAxisX, SharedAxisY and SharedAxisZ transitions." />
<DocsExample TExample="AnimationTriggersExample" Title="Render and manual triggers" Description="Render animates above-the-fold content on render. Manual is driven by the Shown parameter." />
<DocsExample TExample="AnimationStaggerExample" Title="Staggered list" Description="Tag renders a list and Stagger animates each li in sequence." />
